@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
mainframe **sd** collect and format statement rows

participant ":PaymentCommands" as Commands
participant ":TutorLedgerData" as Data
participant "student:Student" as Student
participant "lesson:Lesson" as Lesson

activate Commands
Commands -> Student : read student ID and name
activate Student
Student --> Commands : heading details and filter ID
deactivate Student
Commands -> Data : getLessons()
activate Data
Data --> Commands : all lessons
deactivate Data
note right of Commands
  Filter by the resolved student ID.
  Sort by date, time, then lesson ID.
  Keep paid, partial, unpaid, future and cancelled lessons.
end note

loop each matching lesson
  Commands -> Lesson : read lesson ID, date, subject, fee and payment details
  activate Lesson
  Lesson --> Commands : saved lesson details
  deactivate Lesson
  note right of Commands : Append a formatted row.\nShow the amount received for partial payments.
end

note right of Commands
  Build the heading and rows, or an empty-history message.
  Saved fees are not recalculated from current hourly rates.
end note
deactivate Commands
@enduml
